# Terraform defines the Windows VM

- This lesson is Terraform and the Windows Server only. There is no Ansible and no media stack.
- Terraform defines `libvirt_pool`, `libvirt_network`, `libvirt_volume`, and `libvirt_domain` in `main.tf`.
- The installer ISO is never deleted. It stays at `/home/cosmin/Downloads/SERVER_EVAL_x64FRE_en-us.iso`. A copy is staged into `/var/lib/libvirt/images` so QEMU can boot it. The Downloads file remains the original.
- Do not `virsh undefine windows-srv-test` while that domain is in Terraform state.
